          </div>
          <p class="muted">Pin and unpublish live on the <a href="#readers">Readers</a> tab's story table. Moderation rules can also be edited directly in <a href={`https://github.com/${repo}/edit/main/pipeline/digest/moderation.yaml`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">moderation.yaml</a>.</p>
        </section>

